{
  "DARV.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.char": "打扰了，你见过一个外来的年轻人吗？是我们旅社的老板。有时……会变成猫。",
  "DARV.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-1.ancient": "会变猫？我这儿什么稀奇东西都有，可没收过这样的老板！拿块宝石去吧，找人也得有点好装备！",
  "DARV.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-0r.ancient": "又来找线索啦？今天也没见着你的老板！不过那堆东西里有些新货，自己挑挑吧！",
  "DARV.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.ancient": "你背着刀，还背着锅？找个人而已，怎么像要搬家呀？",
  "DARV.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.next": "解释",
  "DARV.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.char": "要走很远的路嘛。同伴饿着肚子，怎么找人？而且老板回来以后，也要吃饭的。",
  "DARV.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-2.ancient": "有道理，有道理！我的收藏可不能叫客人饿着肚子拿走。看看吧，兴许真有能帮你的！",

  "NEOW.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.char": "你能让倒下的人重新站起来？那你知不知道，我失踪的老板在哪里？",
  "NEOW.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-1.ancient": "[sine]...外来的... ..气息.....\n...向上... ..去.....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]...又... ..回来了.....\n...拿起... ..你的刀.....\n...建筑师... ..还活着.....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.ancient": "[sine]...找到... ..他以后.....\n...你还会... ..战斗么.....？[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.next": "回答",
  "NEOW.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.char": "有人伤害我的家人，我就会拔刀。可我不会因为你叫我杀谁，就去杀谁。",
  "NEOW.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-2.ancient": "[sine]...那么... ..继续找.....\n...你会... ..走到... ..那里.....[/sine]",

  "NONUPEIPE.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.char": "唔好意思，我在找人。如果这些衣服能挡住塔里的攻击……能让我看看吗？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-1.ancient": "衣服？这是我的赐福，小姑娘。过来吧，让你有力气找到那个人，也让他看看你有多么光彩照人。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-0r.ancient": "又弄得灰头土脸了？找人也该体面些。过来，让我看看上次的赐福被你用成什么样了。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.ancient": "你很在意那个人看见你的模样么？我可以让他再也移不开眼睛。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.next": "回答",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.char": "啊？不、不是这个……只要他平安回来就好。他见过我头发烧焦的样子，也没嫌弃过我。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-2.ancient": "真是个奇怪的姑娘。不过，我喜欢你这份心意。收下赐福，下次别再把头发烧焦了。",

  "OROBAS.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.char": "你走过很多地方吗？有没有见过一扇门，另一边是山林和一间旅社？",
  "OROBAS.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-1.ancient": "门！很多门！！山林？旅社？没见过！带上这个找找，找到了告诉欧洛巴斯！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-0r.ancient": "小厨师！！找到人了吗？没有？那就换个办法！这个，这个试过没有？！",
  "OROBAS.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.ancient": "奇怪！你有人的气味，还有别的气味！！耳朵！耳朵也很奇怪！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.next": "解释",
  "OROBAS.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.char": "我爸爸是人类，阿妈是精灵……唔好盯着耳朵看啦，它们又不会告诉你老板在哪里。",
  "OROBAS.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-2.ancient": "原来如此！！不看耳朵，看路！拿上礼物，继续找！！",

  "PAEL.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.char": "你也在做梦吗？我们收到的求救声音，像是从一场走不出来的梦里传来的。",
  "PAEL.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-1.ancient": "[thinky_dots]不是我的梦……不过，那声音还在呼唤你们。让我的一部分陪你走吧……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]小姑娘，你太累了……歇一会儿。急着救人的手，也会发抖……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]你很害怕……害怕到了那里，已经太迟了……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.next": "回答",
  "PAEL.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.char": "……是。我找过失踪的家人，知道那种感觉。可这次有人陪着我，我们一定会找到他。",
  "PAEL.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]那就记住她们在你身边……收下我的力量。别让恐惧先耗尽了你……[/thinky_dots]",

  "TANX.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.char": "这把刀是家里传下来的。塔里有东西拦着我们找人，我要用它把路打开。",
  "TANX.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-1.ancient": "[b]好刀！！但只有一把怎么够！拿上武器，把拦路的家伙全打倒！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-0r.ancient": "[b]小小的刀客！你又变强了！！再拿一把武器，去救你要救的人！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.ancient": "[b]站稳！拔刀！让我看看你有没有本事保护家人！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.next": "切磋",
  "TANX.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.char": "请指教！……好大的力气！不过，我还握得住刀，再来！",
  "TANX.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-2.ancient": "[b]好！！没有丢下你的刀！收下武器，把这股劲带进下一场战斗！！[/b]",

  "TEZCATARA.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.char": "这锅汤闻起来好香……你也喜欢给人做饭吗？我在旅社做厨师。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-1.ancient": "小厨师呀，当然喜欢！快来尝尝。吃饱了才有力气把那些坏东西[jitter][b]烧干净[/b][/jitter]，对不对？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-0r.ancient": "又瘦了呀，小可爱！光给别人做饭可不行。过来，让我好好[jitter][b]照顾[/b][/jitter]你。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.ancient": "等你找到那个老板，把他也带过来吧。要是他害你受了这么多苦，我就替你[jitter][b]教训[/b][/jitter]他。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.next": "解释",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.char": "不是他的错。他是为了保护我们才失踪的……找到他以后，我想让他好好吃一顿，睡一觉。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-2.ancient": "好吧，真是个护着家人的孩子。先把你自己照顾好，带上我的礼物，让欺负你们的东西吃点[jitter][b]苦头[/b][/jitter]。",

  "VAKUU.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.char": "你说能帮我找人……代价呢？先讲清楚。",
  "VAKUU.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-1.ancient": "这么警惕？我只是给你一些[sine]力量[/sine]。至于你能不能活着带他回去，那就是另一回事了。",
  "VAKUU.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-0r.ancient": "还没找回来？我很好奇，你会先耗尽[sine]勇气[/sine]，还是先耗尽那些愿意陪你的人。",
  "VAKUU.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.ancient": "要是他已经变成了[sine]怪物[/sine]呢？斩灵师，你的刀还能落下去么？",
  "VAKUU.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0.next": "回答",
  "VAKUU.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.char": "我也是你嘴里的怪物。老板没有因为这个丢下我，我也不会丢下他。收起你的笑吧。",
  "VAKUU.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-2.ancient": "呵，真动听。拿上礼物，我很期待看你在[sine]不得不选择[/sine]的时候，还能不能这么坚定。",

  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0r.ancient": "刀和锅。涅奥这次送来的，是个厨师？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-1r.char": "我是来找老板的。他被困在这里的某个地方。你有没有见过他？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.0-2r.ancient": "又一个想让我找回什么的人。我没有替你保管你的老板。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.TEST_CHARACTER.0-attack": "Both",

  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-0r.ancient": "你又来了。涅奥倒是很喜欢让人重复做无用的事。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-1r.char": "他留下的痕迹就在塔里。只要还有线索，我就会继续找。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.1-2r.ancient": "那你该追着他的痕迹走。别把你的执念带到我面前。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.TEST_CHARACTER.1-attack": "Both",

  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0r.ancient": "你身上有不属于这里的梦境气息。你们究竟带来了什么？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-0r.next": "解释",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1r.char": "我们在追一场困住老板的梦。我们会把他带走，也会关上通往家里的门。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.YOG_SOTHOTH_S_YARD_CHARACTER_HAA_LOU_LING.2-2r.ancient": "外来的梦，就由你们自己收拾。我的塔已经够吵了。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.TEST_CHARACTER.2-attack": "Both"
}
